for [<MET>M[_____]</MET><ENG> R[_____]</ENG> Riprap,] [Grouted<MET> M[_____]</MET><ENG> R[_____]</ENG> Riprap,] [[Manufactured] Derrick Stone,] [and] [Capstone,] 
[Stone,] [Bedding/Mattress Stone,] [Splash/Fill Stone,] [Armor/Cover Stone,] [Core/Underlayer/Scour Stone].  
