<BRK/>
<TAI OPT="CHAN-PROT"><TXT>Payment for stone satisfactorily placed in constructing the [trenchfill revetment,] [stonefill dikes,] [stonefill 
revetments and junctions,] [excluding trenchfill revetments, wrap-around,] [dike capouts,] [reinforcements,] 
