all plant, labor, stone, and performing all work necessary in placing the stone in constructing the trenchfill 
revetment, bank paving, and drainage structures as specified herein or shown on the drawings.  Full payment for 
stone will not be permitted until trenchfill bank paving has been completed in a satisfactory manner.  Twenty 
