of an obstruction will be paid for under pay item "Stone Placement Premium".</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>[Graded Stone ["A"] ["B"] ["C"]] [[_____] [Stone][Riprap]], Small Repairs, will be measured for payment 
based upon the quantities of stone satisfactorily placed.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Unit of measure: <MET>ton (metric)</MET><ENG> ton</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>[Graded Stone ["A"] ["B"] ["C"]] [[_____] [Stone][Riprap]], Large Repairs</TTL><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Payment will be made for costs associated with [Graded Stone ["A"] ["B"] ["C"]] [[_____] [Stone][Riprap]], 
Large Repairs, satisfactorily placed, which includes furnishing all material, equipment, and labor; placing 
the stone, including overbank paving and stone fills; dressing of subgrade; and performing other work 
