<BRK/>
<TXT>The intention is that the work is built generally to the required elevations, slope and grade and that the outer 
surfaces are even and present a neat appearance.  Remove or rearrange placed material not meeting these limits 
as directed by the Contracting Officer.  Payment will not be made for excess material which the Contracting Officer 
allows to remain in place.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</PRT><PRT><TTL>PART 2   PRODUCTS</TTL><BRK/>
