<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>General</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Submit the source for materials used in riprap[,] [ and] [filter][,] [ and] [bedding].  Provide bedding material 
consisting of [a washed ] [gravel or] crushed stone.  Submit test reports attesting that the [bedding material] 
[,] [and] [filter material] meet specified requirements.</TXT><BRK/>
