<BRK/>
<TXT>Ensure bedding material is composed of tough, durable particles, adequately free from thin, flat and elongated 
pieces, and contains no organic matter nor soft, friable particles in quantities considered objectionable by 
the Contracting Officer.  Provide aggregates meeting the quality requirements of <RID>ASTM C33/C33M</RID>[ or paragraph 
REGULATORY REQUIREMENTS].  Use gradation conforming to the following requirements:</TXT><BRK/>
